                                "sense_id": "b5cd8a44-caa3-32fa-bb45-5f6a0da5da88",
                                "text": "1865, Henry David Thoreau, Cape Cod, Chapter IX. \"The Sea and the Desert\", page 183.\nThese, and such as these, were all the cultivated and cultivable land in Provincetown."
